# This directory stores rendered artifact files.
# Per docs/plans/fact_redesign.md lines 514-515 and 566:
# - Rendered artifacts are named <artifact_id>.<ext>
# - Extension determined by artifact_format MIME type:
#   - .md for text/markdown
#   - .mmd for text/x-mermaid
#   - .yml for application/yaml
# - Populated by rendering pipeline in subsequent phase (step 4 of lifecycle)
#
# This file ensures the directory is tracked by git.
